      "body": "I don't think this can be right.  Partly because if it is you'd need to guard *every* use of `view->buf` and not just that one. And you'd probably have to do that in a thread-safe way. But also because `memoryview` owns `view` so nothing else should even have access to modify `view` and make it \"no longer valid\".",
